{"meta":{"id":"tt0089489","type":"movie","name":"Fuerza Vital","imdb_id":"tt0089489","description":"La nave espacial angloamericana \"Churchill\" va en misión de estudio hacia el cometa Halley, que se acerca a la Tierra. Antes de llegar a su destino, encuentran una nave extraterrestre que viaja en la cola del famoso cometa. La nave atrae la curiosidad de los astronautas quienes, al mando del comandante de la misión, el coronel Tom Carlsen (Steve Railsback), se lanzan a su investigación. En el interior sólo hallan tres ataudes de cristal con dos hombres y una mujer, los tres desnudos, los tres lozanos y enteramente humanoides. Esto dará origen, a la postre, a una epidemia vampírica y a un alucinante caos en Londres, que se verá dominada por zombies-vampiros.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt0089489.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8SnnGg0cqfa3bmorOERNrXvZ8Mn.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nOaY11XYBhuDxWdFfJ2O6V1RxeH.png","genres":["Terror","Ciencia ficción","Acción"],"releaseInfo":"1985","released":"1985-06-21T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"102 min","imdbRating":"6.2","country":"United Kingdom, United States of America","cast":["Steve Railsback","Peter Firth","Frank Finlay","Mathilda May","Patrick Stewart","Michael Gothard","Nicholas Ball","Aubrey Morris","Nancy Paul","John Hallam","John Keegan","Chris Jagger","Bill Malin","Derek Benfield","Jerome Willis","John Woodnutt","John Forbes-Robertson","Peter Porteous","Katherine Schofield","Owen Holder","Jamie Roberts","Russell Sommers","Paul Cooper","Patrick Connor","Sidney Kean","Chris Sullivan","Milton Cadman","Rupert Baker","Gary Hildreth","Edward Evans"],"director":["Tobe Hooper"],"writer":["Colin Wilson","Dan O'Bannon","Don Jakoby","Michael Armstrong","Olaf Pooley"],"trailers":[{"source":"B18wv1oAJGc","type":"Trailer","name":"Lifeforce (1985) Original Trailer [HD]","ytId":"B18wv1oAJGc","lang":"en"},{"source":"sgT